      ],
      "verbatim_texts": [
        "To start the process, Course Packet Information Received should be sent"
      ],
      "justification": "Implicit process initialization and explicit first action directly align with the opening clause."
    },
    {
      "refs": [
        "action:n3"
      ],
      "verbatim_texts": [
        "followed by sending the Design to Faculty."
      ],
      "justification": "Direct sequential step correspondence."
    },
    {
      "refs": [
        "action:n3b"
      ],
      "verbatim_texts": [
        "After sending the Design to Faculty, the Faculty will choose the design."
      ],
      "justification": "Exact alignment with the faculty selection step."
    },
    {
      "refs": [
        "guard:b1->n6",
        "action:n6"
      ],
      "verbatim_texts": [
        "If there is a need to \"Contact Faculty to inform of denial and ask if new content should be added\", then the process should be continued."
      ],
      "justification": "Positive guard and corresponding action faithfully restate the conditional requirement and step."
    },
    {
      "refs": [
        "guard:b1->n7",
        "action:n7"
      ],
      "verbatim_texts": [
        "However, if the \"Entire Course Packet Copyright Cleared\", then the MPC should Calculate the Course Packet Cost."
      ],
      "justification": "Alternative guard and calculation action align with the cleared path."
    },
    {
      "refs": [
        "action:n8"
      ],
      "verbatim_texts": [
        "After calculating the Course Packet Cost, the MPC should add the Bookstore margin to determine the retail price."
      ],
      "justification": "Direct match for the price determination step."
    },
    {
      "refs": [
        "branch:b2"
      ],
      "verbatim_texts": [
        "If the Faculty needs to reconsider the course packet content to decrease the price, then the process should be continued. Alternatively, if the Price of the Course Packet is finalized,"
      ],
      "justification": "Second decision point corresponds to the reconsideration-versus-finalization split described in the unit."
    },
    {
      "refs": [
        "guard:b2->n12",
        "action:n12"
      ],
      "verbatim_texts": [
        "If the Faculty needs to reconsider the course packet content to decrease the price, then the process should be continued."
      ],
      "justification": "Guard and action capture the reconsideration path."
    },
    {
      "refs": [
        "guard:b2->n10",
        "action:n10"
      ],
      "verbatim_texts": [
        "then the MPC should notify the Bookstore of the Course packet, Course number, Faculty name, and sections."
      ],
      "justification": "Finalization guard outcome and notification action align with the unit."
    },
    {
      "refs": [
        "end:e1"
      ],
      "verbatim_texts": [
        "Once the MPC notifies the Bookstore, the Packet information should be notified to the Bookstore, and the process will end."
      ],
      "justification": "Explicit termination phrase maps to the end node."
    }
  ],
